Z||000000||MoneypitGT||12-23-2001||01:32 PM||||Does it matter which throttle cable you use for the Q4, with or without cruise control? <BR> Chris<P>------------------<BR>  <B>Check out my site at:</B>   <A HREF="http://www.customdynamix.com" TARGET=_blank>www.customdynamix.com</A> <BR>Turbo Q4 GT Project||||reg||5
Z||000001||pherder||12-23-2001||01:57 PM||||I used the 87-88 L4 throttle cable to the Quad 4's "cable box" that has the cables going to the TB and the Cruise control.<P>You will find that the cable is ~ 1" too long.  I made a bracket that bolted to the "box" that extended the mounting point of the cable outwards ~ 1" to take out the slack.  <P>I was looking at having a motorcycle shop silver solder a connection on the throttle cable at the correct spot but then I would have to have a custom cable made again IF that first one broke.  The bracket was the better solution.<P>Hopes this helps.<P>Paul||||reg||1
